# PETAL PARADE: 200 pups with 20,000 points or more earns the Alien too.
game petalparade
wait 5
press A
cheat clear
cheat saved 197
cheat score 19950
cheat put pup 5 7
cheat put pup 5 6
cheat put pup 5 5
cheat put pad 5 4
wait 40
press B
expect score == 20010
expect state == 4
expect goals & 2
expect goals & 4
